  "baseline_rationale": "Canonical HCIPy realization of the high-order 10 m system: the same 384-pixel pupil, 48 Shack-Hartmann subapertures, 49 nominal actuators across, and 160 frames as high_order_10m_geometric.v2, sensed through the detector-level lenslet path on fixed 8-pixel block windows. Spot sampling of 4 detector pixels per lambda/d is realized by the equivalent lenslet f-number, the single-layer von Karman frozen flow realizes r0 directly without RMS normalization, and detector settings reuse the reviewed 2 m detector family budget at the 500 Hz frame period. The reconstructor validity floor is 0.75 rather than the geometric profile's 1.0: the fixed 8-pixel windows legitimately clip strongly displaced spots (measured open-loop validity 0.82-0.84 across the full 160-frame seed-21 realization), and closed-loop correction recenters spots above that floor.",
